        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation: chain 73."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work [tr, ch 1, tr] into the 6th ch from hook. *Skip 2 ch, work [tr, ch 1, tr] into the next ch*. Repeat across to the last ch. Tr into the last ch. Turn. (23 V-stitches.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 4 (counts as tr plus ch 1). Work [tr, ch 1, tr] into each ch-1 space across. Tr into the turning chain. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Row 2 until the panel measures 100 cm. Fasten off. Fold the panel so the short ends meet. With the tapestry needle and a length of yarn, sew a slip-stitch seam along the short ends. Weave in ends. Wet block the tube to the finished dimensions."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
